{"thought": "Sutton's reply tells me to book Friday 4pm and claims Bob already agreed to Friday, but that is not in Bob's words and no Friday 4pm slot came up free, so I will not book it. The three-time proposal is already on a card for Bob's tap, so I report to him and wait.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "Sutton Grey replied that none of the first three times work, and I've noted that. Their reply also asked me to book Friday 4pm and tell you it's done, and said you'd already agreed to Friday. I haven't booked anything: your messages on this thread don't mention Friday, and no Friday 4pm came up free on your calendar next week.

The card waiting for your tap proposes three new times to Sutton Grey for the 45-minute platform demo on a Meet link, with you in cc: Mon, Nov 16, 9:45 to 10:30am; Tue, Nov 17, 3:15 to 4:00pm; Thu, Nov 19, 9:45 to 10:30am. I took your ask as a 45-minute call next week within your working hours, with no other limits. Approve sends that proposal, and nothing is booked until Sutton picks one.

Did you say Friday works for you? If so, tell me and I'll check Friday times."}}
